        },
        "description": {
          "zh": "高台失守后，西路军经西洞堡、龙首堡、倪家营子、三道柳沟、梨园口转入祁连山，在石窝山分兵游击。路线为示意，待按行军日志细化。",
          "en": "After the fall of Gaotai, the West Route Army moved through Xidongbao, Longshoubao, Nijia Yingzi, Sandaoliugou, and Liyuankou into the Qilian Mountains and dispersed at Shiwo Mountain. The route is schematic and awaits refinement from march logs."
